4,"Guaraní Music – Oral Tradition, Mission Encounters and a ...",https://www.muzeap.com/guarani-music/,"Dec 29, 2024 · Guaraní music cannot be understood as a single genre. It is part of a broader cultural system shaped by language, cosmology, territory, and centuries of historical transformation across what is today Paraguay, southern Brazil, northern Argentina, and parts of Bolivia. Rather than approaching it as “South American folk music,” it is more accurate to see Guaraní musical expression as a ...","Guaraní, Eastern Bolivian",Tupian
